                        Immunocompetent hosts >2 years: 30 mg/kg/day divided q 8 hr or 1500 mg/m2/
                        day divided q 8 hr for 7–10 days(11)
                        Immunocompromised hosts
                              <12 years: 60 mg/kg/day divided q 8 hr for 7 days(2)
                              >12 years: 30 mg/kg/day divided q 8 hr for 7 days(2)
