IV push                 Rapid infusion is not recommended.(58) Although not recommended, aminoglycosides have
                        been given over 15 seconds,(60) 1 minute,(61) and 3–5 minutes.(62,71)


Intermittent infusion   Over 30–60 minutes.(2,58) Infusion over 1–2 hours is recommended in infants.(2)


