                       USP reports that amphotericin B lipid complex has been confused with amphotericin B
                       desoxycholate; no patient harm resulted.(2) ISMP reports that Abelcet has been confused
                       with amphotericin B.(3) USP reports that Abelcet has been confused with Ambisome; patient
                       harm and death resulted.(2)


