cautions               within 1–2 hours after administration.(4) Infusion-related reactions may be managed by
                       decreasing the rate of infusion or by premedicating with antihistamines or corticosteroids.
                       Stop infusion immediately in cases of severe respiratory distress.(4)
                       Chest discomfort has been reported.(5)
                       Hypertension has been reported in an adult.(6)


