delivery                exists supporting Y-site administration for a number of different medications.(3,24) Check
                        IV compatibility listings.
                        To reconstitute, bring refrigerated vial to room temperature, then aseptically add 10.8 mL of
                        NS, sterile water for injection, or bacteriostatic water for injection with methylparabens and
                        propylparabens, or bacteriostatic water for injection with 0.9% benzyl alcohol to the vial.
                        Aseptically transfer the appropriate volume (mL) of reconstituted product to an IV bag
                        containing 250 mL of 0.9%, 0.45% or 0.225% NaCl or LR. Alternatively, the volume (mL)
                        of reconstituted product can be added to a reduced volume of 0.9%, 0.45%, or 0.225%
