                                  administered by continuous infusion; however, intermittent 30-minute maintenance infu-
                                  sions of 20 mg once or twice daily have been studied in adults.(9)


Continuous infusion               The manufacturer recommends that maintenance doses are to be administered via con-
                                  tinuous infusion.(4)


