delivery                cyclophosphamide reconstituted with SW is hypotonic and should not be administered by
                        direct IV injection; dilute with suitable diluents prior to IV administration.(3,10) Shake vial
                        vigorously after adding diluents to dissolve all the powder; allow vial to stand for a few
                        minutes if powder still apparent.(3)
