cautions               have been reported.(4,5) Aliquots of phentolamine mesylate (0.1–0.2 mg/kg up to 10 mg
                       in 10 mL NS) should be injected intradermally into the ischemic area.(5) (See Appendix E
                       for additional information regarding extravasation treatment.)
