                       Tachycardia, arrhythmias (premature ventricular contractions), and hypertension may
                       occur, especially at greater infusion rates.(4,25,26) The tachycardia produced by dobutamine
                       may make it unacceptable for use in children after cardiopulmonary bypass.(7)


