                       Shock, heart failure: Initial doses of 0.5–1 mcg/kg/min(7,8,25,26) titrated every few min-
                       utes to desired clinical effect, usually 2–20 mcg/kg/min,(4,7-19,25) up to 25 mcg/kg/min in
                       neonates.(6) Given the wide variability in clearance, doses must be individualized.(8,20,21)
                       (See Pharmacokinetic Considerations in the Comments section.)


