                        otherwise discolored.(4,47-50) Protect from excessive heat and freezing.(4,47-50) Brief expo-
                        sure to 40°C does not affect product.(4) Diluted dopamine solutions are stable for at least
                        24 hours.(47,50)


IV push                 Not indicated(4,47-50)


Intermittent infusion   Not indicated(4,47-50)


