delivery                             product literature should be consulted for detailed instructions.
                                     Available as disposable, prefilled syringes, or prefilled SureClick autoinjector (25 mg/0.5 mL,
                                     50 mg/mL). Must be refrigerated until use.(2)
                                     Delivery system issues: Allow to come to room temperature (~15–20 minutes) prior
