                                                                                                    Ferric Gluconate
Comments                            Monitoring: Goal serum ferritin >100 ng/mL and transferrin saturation >20%.(8)
                                    Pharmacokinetic considerations: A study in pediatric hemodialysis patients determined
                                    that the area-under-the-concentration time curve (mg × hr/L) was greater in children
                                    than a comparative group of adults. Clearance was slower in children.(13)
                                    Other: A reaction to one parenteral iron product does not predict a similar response to a
                                    different product nor does the lack of a reaction to a test dose predict that a hypersensi-
                                    tivity reaction will not occur during infusion of subsequent doses.(6,12)



