                        nystagmus, lasting 60 minutes within 2 hours of a single dose of 15 mg/kg of fomepizole(10)
                        Monitoring: Serum concentrations of fomepizole should be assessed. Although concentra-
                        tions of 0.8 mg/L inhibit alcohol dehydrogenase in most patients, values of 8.2–24.6 mg/L
                        are seen following normal dosing.(17) Plasma/urinary ethylene glycol or methanol levels,
                        urinary oxalate (ethylene glycol), plasma/urinary osmolality, renal/hepatic function, serum
