delivery                skin or mucous membranes. If contact occurs, wash skin thoroughly with soap and water
                        and rinse eyes thoroughly with plain water.(2)
                        Stability: Reconstitute 500 mg in 10 mL of SW and then dilute to ≤10 mg/mL in suitable
                        diluents.(2,31) BW (containing parabens) is incompatible with ganciclovir; reconstitution
                        with BW may cause precipitation.(2,31)
