                    Other warnings: Aminoglycosides can cause neuromuscular blockade and potentiate the
                    effects of neuromuscular blockers.(3,6,7) If neuromuscular blockade occurs, calcium salts
                    may reverse it.(3) (See Appendix C for specific information.)


