                        Acute
                            Infants and young children: IV bolus of 1–2 mg/kg followed by 25–150 mg/
                            day divided q 6–8 hr.(6) Alternatively, the AAP recommends 2–3 mg/kg (max
                            100 mg) followed by 1–5 mg/kg q 6 hr.(16)




