                 encouraged in the following situations: febrile illness (temperature >38.5°C), gastroen-
                 teritis with dehydration, surgery accompanied by general anesthesia, and major trauma.
                     Infants and preschoolers: Initial bolus 25 mg IV followed by 30–60 mg/m2/day
