                       Common pediatric regimens include 1.2–1.8 g/m2/day for 5 days q 21–28 days or 5 g/
                       m2/dose as a single 24-hour infusion or 3 g/m2/day for 2 days.(3-7) High-dose therapy with
                       3.5 g/m2/day for 5 days has also been used.(8)

