Additives               When the lyophilized powder is reconstituted with the provided diluent (SW), each mL
                        contains 20 mg glycine, 2.3 mg sodium phosphate dibasic, 0.55 mg sodium phosphate
                        monobasic, and 1 mg albumin (human).(2)
                        Each mL of the solution vials for injection (given IM, sub-Q, intralesional) and the mul-
