Contraindications      Contraindications: Hypersensitivity to labetalol or any component. Patients with a
and warnings           history of anaphylactic hypersensitivity reactions may be more reactive while receiving
                       beta-blockers; these patients may not be responsive to the normal doses of epinephrine.
                       (See Anaphylaxis/bronchospams in the Comments section for management of hypersen-
