                           transplantation(14)
                       Aplastic anemia: 10–20 mg/kg/day for 5–14 days,(1,15-17,28) or 40 mg/kg/day for 4
                       days(18-22)
                       Graft-versus-host disease: 30 mg/kg/day every other day for 6 doses(23) or 30 mg/kg/
                       day divided BID for 5 days for steroid-resistant disease.(24)


