                        Renal and hepatic rejection(1-6):
                            ≤30 kg: 2.5 mg/day for 10–14 days
                            >30 kg: 5 mg/day for 10–14 days
                        Cardiac transplant rejection(7):
                            <10 kg: 1.25 mg/kg/day for 10 days
