                                   Monitoring: Aspartate aminotransaminase (AST) and alanine aminotransferase (ALT)
                                   values should be obtained periodically during therapy to monitor for possible liver func-
                                   tion abnormalities.(2)
                                   Drug interactions: Concurrent use of tetracycline should be avoided as it may antago-
                                   nize the bactericidal effect of penicillin.(2) Probenecid may decrease the tubular secretion
