                       16 g/day.(2,6) Those weighing more than 40 kg should receive adult dose of 12 g/day
                       divided q 6 hr.(2) Based on a single-dose pharmacokinetic study, doses of 100 mg/kg
                       q 8 hr for bacteria whose minimum inhibitory concentration (MIC) is 2 mg/L and q 6 hr
                       if the MIC is between 4 and 8 mg/L should be effective.(7)
                       Cystic fibrosis: Up to 600 mg/kg/day divided q 4 hr has been recommended.(31)

