                                    erative use of piperacillin may prolong the neuromuscular blockade of vecuronium or other
                                    nondepolarizing muscle relaxants.(2) Probenecid may decrease the clearance of piperacillin.(2)
                                    Consult appropriate resources before combining any drug with piperacillin-tazobactam.
                                    Laboratory interference: A false-positive urinary glucose results when cupric sulfate
