                       been reported following repackaging(29) or improper storage of propofol(30) and Intralipid.(31)
                       If propofol is transferred to a syringe or other container, the transfer should be done as
                       soon as the vial is opened and the product should be discarded and administration lines
                       changed after 12 hours.(4)
                       Compatibility: D5W, D5LR, D5¼NS, D5½NS, LR. See Appendix D and other appropriate
                       resources for PN compatibility information.




