                    If the heparin was administered by deep sub-Q injection, 1–1.5 mg protamine/100 USP
                    heparin units should be used. As an example, part of the dose (i.e., 25–50 mg) can be
                    given over 10 minutes followed by an infusion of the remaining calculated dose over
