and warnings        binemia.(1,2) Interference with uric acid assessment due to uric acid degradation may also
                    occur.(1,2) (See Laboratory Interference in the Comments section.)
                    Contraindications: Patients with a known hypersensitivity to rasburicase or any com-
                    ponents, past or known history of hemolytic reactions to drug or any components, and
                    glucose-6-phosphatase dehydrogenase (G6PD) deficiencies.(1,2) (See Significant Adverse
                    Effects in the Comments section.)
