Comments (cont.)                     Monitoring: Large doses of thiopental leads to a pronounced fall in serum potassium;
                                     therefore, monitor serum potassium.(32)
                                     Drug interactions: Consult appropriate resources for dosing recommendations before
                                     combining any drug with thiopental.
                                     Pharmacokinetic considerations: Recovery time after large or repeated doses may be
                                     more rapid for infants and children compared to adults because of a higher clearance.(33)


