                     Age >12 months and ≤20 kg
                         Target 20 mcg/mL: Loading dose, 4 mg/kg over 15 minutes; infusion,
                         2 mg/kg/hr during surgery; CPB prime dose, 20 mcg per mL of CPB prime volume.
                         Target 60 mcg/mL: Loading dose, 13 mg/kg over 15 minutes; infusion,
                         5.5 mg/kg/hr during surgery; CPB prime dose, 60 mcg per mL of CPB prime volume.
