                                  receiving VariZIG.(4)
                                  The Advisory Committee on Immunization Practices (ACIP) recommends VariZIG
                                  for the following groups:
                                        Patients at high risk for severe varicella infection and complications
                                        Patients exposed to varicella or herpes zoster
                                        Patients in whom varicella vaccine is contraindicated
