                                        Hospitalized premature infants born at >28 weeks gestation whose mothers do not
                                        have evidence of immunity to varicella
                                        Hospitalized premature infants born at <28 weeks gestation or with a birth weight of
                                        <1000 g, regardless of the mothers’ evidence of immunity
                                        Pregnant women without evidence of immunity


